[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unitworldenvmissing"]

; A WorldEnvironment whose Environment .tres does not exist. Godot loads no Environment, so the node
; never joins the world's group (world_environment.cpp:40-41) and the root draws with none, as in
; unit-world-environment-none.tscn. Every other golden's reference resolves, so only this one shows
; a reference that never loads. The two goldens draw the same pixels.

